WEBVTT

00:09:27.996 --> 00:09:30.836
même vous et moi ici dans cette pièce,

00:09:30.876 --> 00:09:34.556
sommes incorporés dans le tissu du monde.

00:09:35.596 --> 00:09:36.636
Tic-tac, tic-tac,

00:09:36.676 --> 00:09:37.756
tic-tac,

00:09:37.796 --> 00:09:38.836
tic-tac.

00:09:38.876 --> 00:09:40.836
Dahganah, denah, dahganah,

00:09:40.876 --> 00:09:43.116
dahganah, denah, dahganah.

00:09:45.556 --> 00:09:46.676
Merci.

00:09:46.676 --> 00:09:53.436
(Acclamations et applaudissements)